---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Gelukt! — Kindvrij Amsterdam"
  description="Je aanmelding voor de praatgroep is ontvangen."
>
  <style>
    .page {
      min-height: 100svh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .card {
      max-width: 620px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .check {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      background: rgba(46, 74, 62, 0.1);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .label {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--terracotta);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--forest);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--warm-gray);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(46, 74, 62, 0.12);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .details-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--warm-gray-light);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .details {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .detail-key {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--forest);
      min-width: 90px;
      padding-top: 0.05rem;
    }

    .detail-val {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--warm-gray);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .note {
      background: rgba(46, 74, 62, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(46, 74, 62, 0.12);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--warm-gray);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .back {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--warm-gray);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
      transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .back:hover {
      color: var(--forest);
      border-color: var(--forest-muted);
    }
  </style>

  <div class="page">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="check">✓</div>
      <p class="label">Aanmelding bevestigd</p>
      <h1>Welkom bij<br /><em>de praatgroep.</em></h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Je betaling is ontvangen en je plek is gereserveerd. Hieronder vind je
        de details voor de eerste bijeenkomst. Tot snel!
      </p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="details-label">Details eerste sessie</p>
      <div class="details">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-key">Datum</span>
          <span class="detail-val">Zaterdag 25 april 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-key">Tijd</span>
          <span class="detail-val">15:00 – 17:00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-key">Locatie</span>
          <span class="detail-val">Studio Brecht<br />Weteringschans 157, Amsterdam<br />(derde verdieping, bel aan)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-key">Groepsgrootte</span>
          <span class="detail-val">Max. 8 deelnemers</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        Je ontvangt ook een bevestigingsmail. Kun je onverhoopt niet komen?
        Stuur dan een berichtje naar
        <a href="mailto:hallo@kindvrij.amsterdam">hallo@kindvrij.amsterdam</a>.
      </div>

      <a href="/" class="back">← Terug naar de homepage</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
